LTO STORAGE DECISION — series count, bus maximum, downstream numbers
==============================================================================

1. SERIES SELECTION
  N * ceiling <= envelope : 58.4 / 2.7 = 21.6296 -> N <= 21
  N * floor   <= bus min  : 36.0 / 1.8 = 20.0000 -> N <= 19
  selected series count   : N = 20

2. BUS MAXIMUM
  bus maximum = 20 x 2.7 = 54.0 V
  bus minimum = 20 x 1.8 = 36.0 V
  58.4 V would need 2.92 V/cell at 20S
  58.4 / 2.7 = 21.629630 — not an integer, so no series count lands on 58.4 V
  verdict: 58.4 V does NOT survive the LTO decision

  per-candidate ceiling at the same series count:
