    toshiba-scib-2.9ah       2.70 V/cell ->  54.0 V, floor 1.5 V ->  30.0 V   [ceiling is family-level, not cell-level]
    toshiba-scib-10ah        2.80 V/cell ->  56.0 V, floor 1.8 V ->  36.0 V

